    {
      "id": "king-henry-the-fifth/sceneIII_11.5/p@78982",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [],
      "text": "DAUPHIN.\nO Dieu vivant! shall a few sprays of us,\nThe emptying of our fathers’ luxury,\nOur scions put in wild and savage stock,\nSpirt up so suddenly into the clouds,\nAnd overlook their grafters?",
