    {
      "id": "king-henry-the-fifth/sceneIII_11.5/p@80351",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [],
      "text": "BOURBON.\nThey bid us to the English dancing-schools,\nAnd teach lavoltas high, and swift corantos;\nSaying our grace is only in our heels,\nAnd that we are most lofty runaways.",
