      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [],
      "text": "FRENCH KING.\nTherefore, Lord Constable, haste on Montjoy,\nAnd let him say to England that we send\nTo know what willing ransom he will give.\nPrince Dauphin, you shall stay with us in Rouen.",
